Q: Invocation of init method failed; nested exception is java.lang.NullPointerException in Spring 4 Hibernate 4 Project A: <p>In your HibernateConfiguration, try to change sessionFactory() implementation like this:</p>

<pre><code>@Bean
public SessionFactory sessionFactory(DataSource dataSource) {
    LocalSessionFactoryBean sessionFactory = new LocalSessionFactoryBean();
    sessionFactory.setDataSource(dataSource);
    sessionFactory.setPackagesToScan(new String[] { "iiitmk.projects.miniproject.core.beans" });
    sessionFactory.setHibernateProperties(hibernateProperties());

    return sessionFactory.getObject();
 }
</code></pre>

<p>HTH.</p>
